          </div>
          <div class="su__opt-sub">
            Single bottle dispatch. Standard shipping rates apply. No guaranteed batch allocation during high-demand periods.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom Regimen Booster Add-ons -->
        <div class="su__boosters">
          <h4 class="su__booster-title">[ ONE-CLICK REGIMEN BOOSTERS (ADD TO RECURRING DISPATCH) ]</h4>
